# Local tmux config (copied from sample)
tmux.conf
# All nine subrepos are imported now, so no `/name/` entry survives here. The
# rule that governed them is kept as a warning: ANCHOR any such entry
# (`/name/`, not `name`) — an unanchored name matches a directory at ANY depth,
# so a bare `tempest` also swallowed reference/atari-source/tempest/ and 57
# files of vendored ROM source vanished from `git add` without a word.
out/audio/
# Imported subrepos' own .git directories, parked here rather than deleted so the
# pre-monorepo history stays recoverable on this machine. Safe to remove once every
# game is imported and its GitHub remote is confirmed in sync.
.migration-backup/
